Deduction and expansion of a function parameter pack when matching a class
template partial specialization over a function type, e.g. the
std::function<R(A...)> pattern.  Covers zero, one, two and three element
packs and a reference-parameter element, and checks that the specialization
is elaborated so its operator bool is available.
